From: brkosebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 08 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] of: Warm Restart evidence, reset guard and pristine DT

Preserve warm power-domain holds and the ADBE boot framebuffer, add bounded shutdown checkpoints and the cold-reset guard, and retain a correctly mapped ramoops reservation across kexec. Embed per-board pristine DTBs in the matching initrd and archive the actual running boot's pristine tree before updates replace its files. Kernel/module/BLS pairing must remain explicit; DFU is known to erase the retained logs. The new Orchard cold-baseline and three-hop ladder is pending.

Integration fixups are folded into the final delta. Device observations apply
to the integration build; the isolated topic requires qualification.

Assisted-by: LLM
---

diff --git a/drivers/of/of_reserved_mem.c b/drivers/of/of_reserved_mem.c
index 8c9d6395d..76cf3e5a4 100644
--- a/drivers/of/of_reserved_mem.c
+++ b/drivers/of/of_reserved_mem.c
@@ -275,6 +275,16 @@ void __init fdt_scan_reserved_mem_late(void)
 		return;
 	}
 
+	/* Early architecture fixups may have added static reservations. */
+	total_reserved_mem_cnt = reserved_mem_count;
+	fdt_for_each_subnode(child, fdt, node) {
+		int len;
+
+		if (of_fdt_device_is_available(fdt, child) &&
+		    fdt_getprop(fdt, child, "reg", &len) && len)
+			total_reserved_mem_cnt++;
+	}
+
 	/* Attempt dynamic allocation of a new reserved_mem array */
 	if (alloc_reserved_mem_array())
 		return;
